flowchart TD
    %% Send side
    ATTACH([User attaches file to a message]) --> COPY[GUI copies file into app-internal storage]
    COPY --> PREP[Hash → fileId · create per-file AEAD key · classify]
    PREP --> MSG[Publish message with attachment references]
    PREP --> CLASS{file class}

    CLASS -- "small (≤ smallFileMaxBytes)" --> MARKER[OFFER as outbox marker<br>direct link first]
    CLASS -- "large (no upper bound)" --> SESS{WebRTC session open?}
    SESS -- no --> WAIT[Engine waits · never Tor · never relays]
    WAIT --> SESS
    SESS -- yes --> STREAM[Stream AEAD chunks on a per-transfer data channel<br>channel flow control · checkpoint resume]

    MARKER -- "ACK (accepted)" --> CHUNKS[Chunk rows in the outbox · windowed]
    MARKER -- "DECLINED (relay full)" --> NEXTRELAY[Next relay or re-offer later]
    CHUNKS -- "all ACKed" --> PUSHED((push complete))
    CHUNKS -- "stall / link break" --> REM[Remainder = suffix after the<br>highest contiguous ACKed prefix]
    REM --> DEPOSIT[Deposit remainder · identical set<br>at every relay RelaySelectionPolicy returns]
    DEPOSIT --> ADM{Relay admission against<br>relayFileBudgetBytes}
    ADM -- accepted --> HOLD
    ADM -- DECLINED --> OUT([that relay is out · one jump<br>the sender never chases])
    HOLD[Store ciphertext chunks in the relay store<br>PK (transferId, chunkIndex) · signature verified]
    HOLD --> WHOLE{Whole covered suffix?}
    WHOLE -- no --> TTL[Reservation TTL cleans up<br>never pushed, never offered]
    WHOLE -- yes --> FOFFER[OFFER marker to the target<br>stored OFFER payload replayed]
    FOFFER -- ACK --> FWD[Forward chunks from the store<br>per-chunk ACKs delete rows]
    FWD --> DRAINED((transfer row dropped when drained))

    STREAM -- "done · COMPLETE" --> PUSHED

    %% Teardown
    PUSHED --> TEARDOWN[Target-confirmed full receipt or user cancel<br>→ CANCEL outstanding deposits]
    TEARDOWN --> DONE([transfer COMPLETED])

    %% Pull path
    MSG -. "synced / processed by any device" .-> TRIG
    TRIG{Message references a fileId ·<br>no complete local file · no active transfer?} -- yes --> REQ[REQUEST · one candidate at a time<br>sender devices, then own-account siblings]
    REQ -- "OFFER (fresh transferId)" --> SERVE[Holder serves the suffix from the<br>lowest missing index · deterministic ciphertext]
    REQ -- "all DECLINED / expired" --> UNAV([file unavailable])
    SERVE --> MERGE[Receiver merges into its fileId-scoped tracker<br>verify hash → READY]
    FWD -. delivered .-> MERGE
    STREAM -. delivered .-> MERGE
